  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xed;spevok MF SR na projekt &quot;Certifikovan&#xe9; &#x161;kolenie pre &#xfa;&#x10d;tovn&#xed;kov verejn&#xe9;ho sektora v Severnom Maced&#xf3;nsku, &#xfa;rove&#x148; 2&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Slovak Finance Ministry contribution to the project &quot;Public Accountants Certification Training Level 2 in North Macedonia&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Certifikovan&#xe9; &#x161;kolenie pre &#xfa;&#x10d;tovn&#xed;kov verejn&#xe9;ho sektora (Public Accountants&#xb4; Certification Training, PACT) je overen&#xfd; vzdel&#xe1;vac&#xed; produkt CEF a medzin&#xe1;rodnej organiz&#xe1;cie CIPFA (The Chartered Institute of Public Finance and Accountancy). Cie&#x13e;om projektu PACT 2 v Severnom Maced&#xf3;nsku&#xa0; je roz&#x161;&#xed;ri&#x165; skupinu kvalifikovan&#xfd;ch &#xfa;&#x10d;tovn&#xed;kov verejn&#xe9;ho sektora a vytvori&#x165; predpoklady na zavedenie povinn&#xe9;ho odborn&#xe9;ho vzdel&#xe1;vania &#xfa;&#x10d;tovn&#xed;kov.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Public Accountants&apos; Certification Training (PACT) is a certified training product of CEF and the Chartered Institute of Public Finance and Accountancy (CIPFA). The aim of the PACT 2 project in Northern Macedonia is to expand the number of qualified public sector accountants and to create conditions for the introduction of compulsory professional training for the accountants.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
